<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-products.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><a class="admin-product-back" href="/admin/products/<%= product._id %>/edit">&larr; Back to product setup</a><h1>Private Product Files: <%= product.name %></h1><p>Upload actual files customers receive after purchasing. Files are stored privately, outside the public website. The printable pattern is delivered with its base purchase only if enabled; optional paid files are delivered only when the customer selects and pays for that file option. Existing paid downloads keep their original file versions.</p><form id="upload-form" class="studio-form" data-csrf="<%= learningCsrf %>" data-base="/admin/products/<%= product._id %>/digital-files"><label><strong>File Destination</strong><small>Choose which product file this upload belongs to. The base pattern is the main printable file; choose another file for its separate option.</small><select id="destination"><option value="">Base printable pattern — <%= product.digital_file?'file uploaded':'no file uploaded' %></option><% files.forEach(file=>{ %><option value="/<%= file._id %>"><%= file.file_name %> — <%= file.digital_file?'file uploaded':'no file uploaded' %></option><% }) %></select></label><label><strong>Choose Private File</strong><small>Select the real product file to deliver after purchase. Supported types include PDF, DXF, ZIP and other listed pattern formats. Do not upload product photos here.</small><input type="file" id="file" accept=".svg,.aama,.astm,.pdf,.zip,.dxf,.dwg,.ai,.eps,.plt" required></label><p class="admin-product-help">The upload button stores this file in private pattern storage; customers cannot access its source URL directly.</p><button class="btn primary">Upload Private Product File</button><p id="upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %><script src="/js/admin-digital-files.js"></script></body></html>
